<style>
  body {
    font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
    background-color: #f6f9fc;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 520px;
    margin: auto;
    background: #ffffff;
    padding: 28px 24px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .button {
    display: inline-block;
    background-color: #22c55e;
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 12px 24px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 16px;
    text-align: center;
    margin: 24px 0 16px;
  }

  .chat-button {
    display: inline-block;
    background-color: #6366f1;
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 10px 18px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 14px;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }

  .center {
    text-align: center;
  }

  ul {
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin: 16px 0;
  }

  li {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .footer {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #999;
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 32px;
  }

  .logo-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .logo-header img {
    width: 48px;
    height: 48px;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }

  .logo-header h1 {
    font-size: 18px;
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #111827;
  }
</style>

<div class="container">
  <div class="logo-header">
    <img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0743/3119/3628/files/logo2.png?v=1746194276" alt="COD King Logo" />
    <h1>COD King</h1>
  </div>

  <h2>Hello <%= @name %>,</h2>

  <p>You’ve installed <strong>COD King</strong> but haven’t enabled any of its protection features yet.</p>

  <p>
    ❌ Fake orders<br>
    💸 RTO loss<br>
    🧊 Low prepaid conversion
  </p>

  <p>
    COD King can help you solve these — all it takes is 2 minutes to set up:
  </p>

  <ul>
    <li>✅ <strong>OTP Verification</strong> — block fake COD orders</li>
    <li>✅ <strong>Partial Payment</strong> — lock genuine buyer intent</li>
    <li>✅ <strong>COD → Prepaid nudges</strong> + extra COD fee logic</li>
  </ul>

  <p>
    Start using these tools now and increase your prepaid revenue while reducing RTOs.
  </p>

  <div class="center">
    <a href="<%= @tracking_url %>" class="button" target="_blank">
      ⚡ Enable Key Features Now
    </a>

    <p>Need help?</p>

    <a href="<%= @crisp_url %>" class="chat-button" target="_blank">
      💬 Chat With Us Now
    </a>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    <p>For any queries, contact us at <a href="mailto:support@notifiktech.com" style="color: #3b82f6;">support@notifiktech.com</a></p>

    <p>Watch helpful videos on our <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@cod-king-shopify" target="_blank" style="color: #3b82f6;">YouTube Channel</a></p>

    <p style="margin-top: 24px;">
    <a href="http://app.codking.tech/unsubscribe?email=<%= @email %>&source=no_features_enabled"
       style="color: #999; text-decoration: underline; font-size: 12px;">
      Unsubscribe from future reminders
    </a>
  </p>
  </div>
</div>
